# Rendered UI audit output — regenerate with `npm run verify:ui`
theme-audit/

# Generated by `npm run dogfood` from CLAUDE.md — never authored, never committed.
# A committed policy would be a second copy of the ruleset and would drift from it (E-1),
# and a committed licence would be a secret in a public repo.
.enforcee/

# esbuild output for the dev scripts. Under a `dist/` directory on purpose: the invariant
# scanner walks the working tree rather than git, and skips any directory named `dist`.
# A stale bundle in scripts/ failed E-6 on 2026-08-16 with the OLD text of an instruction
# that had already been fixed in source — a generated artefact reporting as a shipped
# surface. Test order was the only thing hiding it: ci.yml happens to run `npm test`
# before `npm run dogfood`.
scripts/dist/

# Learned state, not source. obstacles.json/md are this project's own history — regenerable
# from the transcripts with `enforcee obstacles`, and machine-specific.
.enforcee/obstacles.json
.enforcee/obstacles.md
